<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Yeet A Friend Star/Pet Farm</Major>
    <Description>Intended to work with 2 accounts:
Main Account: Runs around collecting stars (auto)
Second Account: Farms for the secret pets (auto)

Requirements:
~ A computer that supports multiple desktops
~ 2 Roblox Accounts (download the launcher from roblox(dot)com and from an appstore like Microsoft App Store)
~ (not required but preferred) Upgraded Magnet Range

Setup: 
Open Main Account on Desktop 1 and Second Account on Desktop 2.
On second account, go up to the first egg and click every pet so they all have an x over them. Then start autobuying

Screen Resolution: 1920 x 1080

Tip:
If you need energy for auto buying on your second account then rebirth once and trade some pets from your main account so your second account can get lots of energy quickly and then go back to farming pets.</Description>
    <Comment>I recorded this macro on world 12 but it should work in most worlds.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
